   281→        <span class="path">/api/tracks/index/{number}</span>
   282→      </div>
   283→      <p>Retrieve track by index number. Returns the same data as <code>/api/track/{id}.json</code>.</p>
   284→      <div class="example">
   285→        <div class="example-label">Try it:</div>
