   307→        <span class="path">/api/json/{frequency}.tgz</span>
   308→      </div>
   309→      <p>Download compressed archive containing all tracks. Available frequencies: <code>daily</code>, <code>weekly</code>, <code>monthly</code>, <code>yearly</code>.</p>
   310→      <p>Updated once per __ARCHIVE_FREQUENCY__. Enabled when server starts with <code>-json-archive-path</code>.</p>
   311→      <div class="example">
